---
description: Corpus validation and test commands
alwaysApply: false
---

Integrity lives in `scripts/validate.ts`, using the same Zod schemas as `src/lib/schema.ts`.

- Fail the build on duplicate IDs, dangling references, and invalid frontmatter.
- Warnings are allowed for orphans, over-long `related`, and missing locators.
- Do not add third-party HTTP checks to `npm run build`.
- Unit tests: `scripts/validate.test.ts`, `scripts/editorial.test.ts`, and `scripts/formula.test.ts` via `npm test`.
- Canonical quality gate: `npm run qa` (lint, unit tests, validate, Astro typecheck, production build, Pagefind, `dist/` smoke).
- `npm run smoke` requires `dist/` and is not part of `npm test`.
- Editorial reports: `npm run report:sources`, `npm run report:graph`, `npm run suggest:links`. Do not add them to `npm run build`. External URL fetching stays opt-in (`verify:links` or `report:sources -- --check-urls`).
